message: "If you use KnowledgeDrift, please cite this repository."
title: "KnowledgeDrift: an offline, judge-free benchmark for AI memory in software development"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-09-14
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/techtheist/knowledgedrift"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "techtheist"
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - memory
  - retrieval
  - knowledge drift
  - contradiction detection
  - software engineering agents
references:
  - type: article
    title: "ForgetEval"
    url: "https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.15903"
    year: 2026
    notes: "The judge-free forgetting benchmark whose families and two design rules KnowledgeDrift adopts."
  - type: software
    title: "engram"
    url: "https://github.com/techtheist/engram"
    notes: "The reference system and the evaluation harness KnowledgeDrift grew out of."
